    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New Release: 2 Bedroom Showunit with all Contents Included\n\n2 bedroom apartment | c. 73 sq. m.\nAll contents included\nOverlooking the landscaped courtyard\nLarge private terrace\nHigh-quality finishes and specifications throughout\n\n\nWestar Group are delighted to introduce Harbour Gate. This new and exciting development will consist of contemporary 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartment and duplex homes located close to the heart of the thriving and popular commuter town of Naas, Co. Kildare. Naas has plenty to offer the prospective purchaser: a selection of top-rated schools locally coupled with excellent transport links, Naas is also well served with an array of shopping facilities, sports clubs, popular restaurants, bars, and gastro pubs.\nHarbour Gate offers a perfect mix of rural tranquillity and modern convenience, it is located within minutes of the M7 and the Arrow Rail Link at Sallins, and Naas town centre is within a short 5-minute stroll along the Grand Canal.\n \nJoint Agents CME Naas and Dillon Marshall Property Consultants invite you to request your appointment now for this exciting new development.\nImages are for illustrative purposes only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Contemporary 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartment and duplex homes now selling."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Custom designed integrated Kitchen (supplied by Akalim Kitchens) with Stone Italiana quartz worktop and splashback.\nBespoke wardrobes by Akalim throughout all bedrooms as standard.\nLuxury contemporary tiles to bathroom floors and wall wet areas.\nWall mounted heated towel rails in all bathrooms.\nHigh quality sanitary-ware throughout together with extra-large shower cubicle spaces.\nPressurised shower system with rain head shower fittings, thermostatic mixer tap.\nContemporary feature architrave & skirting.\nSatin finish chrome door furniture throughout.\nNordan Eco Aluclad white timber internal window frames with external durable powder-coated aluminium paint finish in Anodic Bronze colour.\nInternal smooth finish painting throughout.\nSuperior quality internal joinery, including high quality timber doors.\nInterior designed entrance lobbies, lifts and common areas.\nIntercom / entry phone system from main block door in each apartment.\nThermostatic-zoned radiator central heating system in single floor apartment units by way of A-rated exhaust air heat pump.\nGenerous number of power points throughout including a number with provision for USB charging.\nA2 BER energy rating.\nHighly insulated air tight design."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Ciara Egan"
      }
